EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

In accordance with the terms of the Agreement, we requested a reconciliation of your future receivables to make sure the remittance amount aligned with your actual receivables.


To complete the request, you required to provide us with the last two months of bank statements for your designated account within 5 days of the request.  We have not received them within the time allotted and as a result, your remittance amount will return to the Initial Remittance amount of {!Case.Payment_Amount__c}, as specified in the agreement.


The remit will be returned to the Initial Remittance amount effective immediately.


Please don’t hesitate to contact us with any questions.




Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
